      "id": "note-rows",
      "x": 564,
      "y": -200,
      "w": 484,
      "text": "Rows by kind\nProfile shift for external spur and helical gears on parallel shafts; Helix angle and Hand for the helical kinds, gear B's hand following gear A's; Groove for a herringbone; Rim for a ring; Shaft angle and Mate teeth for a single bevel gear; Hands for a crossed pair; Assembly for a pair on parallel shafts."
    }
